= Roleplaying Backgrounds & Game Setup

Each wave is designed as a fresh playthrough with its own backstory, difficulty, and recommended settings.

#pagebreak()

== Wave 0: The Uncharted

#block(
  fill: rgb("#F5F0E8"),
  inset: 12pt,
  radius: 4pt,
  stroke: 1pt + rgb("#4A7C9B"),
)[
  _You were nobody._ A fresh graduate from the military academy on Argon Prime. Your assets: one beat-up Discoverer, a few thousand credits, and a chip on your shoulder. The galaxy is vast, dangerous, and utterly indifferent. Every station is a mystery, every gate a leap of faith. You have no allies, no enemies, and no idea what you're doing. Good luck, Commander.
]

=== Recommended Settings

- _Difficulty:_ Normal
- _Game Start:_ Young Gun (tutorial-friendly)
- _DLC:_ None required (play with DLCs disabled or ignore DLC content)
- _Mods:_ None, or UI/QoL only. No mechanics-changing mods.

=== Goals for this Wave

- Complete the flight school tutorial
- Earn your first million credits
- Build your first small station
- Establish positive reputation with at least one faction
- Survive your first pirate encounter

#pagebreak()

== Wave 1: The Opportunist

#block(
  fill: rgb("#F5F0E8"),
  inset: 12pt,
  radius: 4pt,
  stroke: 1pt + rgb("#4A7C9B"),
)[
  _You've paid your dues._ Your early fortune bought you a modest fleet — a handful of miners, a trader, a fighter. But the universe doesn't care about your comfort. New factions eye your territory, pirates hunt your trade lanes, and opportunities vanish as fast as they appear. You see the gaps in the market. You know who to bribe and who to fight. Now it's time to stop surviving and start thriving.
]

=== Recommended Settings

- _Difficulty:_ Moderate (or Custom with higher enemy aggression)
- _Game Start:_ Custom start — "The Unworthy Entrepreneur" (own a small trader + fighter, modest credits, neutral standing)
- _DLC:_ Cradle of Humanity and Split Vendetta recommended
- _Mods:_ Install Wave 0 + Wave 1 mods.

=== Goals for this Wave

- Build a functioning production chain
- Command a fleet of 10+ ships
- Establish a player-owned station with multiple modules
- Complete faction war missions
- Reach 100 million credit net worth

#pagebreak()

== Wave 2: The Warlord

#block(
  fill: rgb("#F5F0E8"),
  inset: 12pt,
  radius: 4pt,
  stroke: 1pt + rgb("#4A7C9B"),
)[
  _The galaxy is a tinderbox._ Xenon fleets push deeper into civilized space. The factions squabble while the real threat grows. Someone needs to take command. Someone with vision, ruthlessness, and a fleet. The Argon Federation needs a hero — or a conqueror. You've built empires from nothing before. This time, you'll do it on a scale that changes the map.
]

=== Recommended Settings

- _Difficulty:_ Hard
- _Game Start:_ Custom start — "Faction Leader" (start with a small fleet, one station, established faction relations)
- _DLC:_ All DLCs required
- _Mods:_ Install Waves 0 through 2 mods.

=== Goals for this Wave

- Build a wharf or shipyard
- Conquer your first sector (claim or destroy a faction's sector)
- Build a mega-station (100+ modules)
- Reach 1 billion credit net worth
- Destroy a Xenon shipyard or installation

#pagebreak()

== Wave 3: Stellar Dominion

#block(
  fill: rgb("#F5F0E8"),
  inset: 12pt,
  radius: 4pt,
  stroke: 1pt + rgb("#4A7C9B"),
)[
  _You come from beyond the void._ No one knows your past. No one trusts you. Every faction sees you as a threat, a predator that appeared from nowhere. The galaxy is unified — in its fear of you. But you know something they don't: the old powers are crumbling. The Xenon are not the real enemy. The real enemy is the stagnation that has gripped the universe for centuries. You will break it. You will reshape the gate network in your image. You will build a Stellar Dominion.
]

=== Recommended Settings

- _Difficulty:_ Very Hard (or Custom with extreme settings)
- _Game Start:_ Custom start — "The Outsider" (hostile with ALL factions, minimal assets, high Xenon activity)
- _DLC:_ All DLCs required
- _Mods:_ Install ALL mods (Waves 0 through 3).

=== Goals for this Wave

- Go from hostile-with-all to at least one allied faction
- Dominate the galactic economy (control 25%+ of total production)
- Destroy a faction's capital shipyard
- Own sectors in at least three different clusters
- Survive an endgame crisis (Xenon mega-fleet or similar)

